title: technology of Inner peace
pid: dab3a936-269d-44e7-b52c-287f6ae004f2
body: |2-
  It is important to know this unity before you die.
  Meditate here. Build the rollercoaster, name and collect connections across ideas.
  Make whatever of it private you like. Use whateer of others' in yours.
  Sometimes don't read it. Let an idea come to you. Do not force it, do not photograph early.
  The knowledge is one. It has assimilated what it will keep of you, and you can kind of see your shadow in it. You can put more of yourself there. Maybe you shouldn't. We are butterflies, crickets at fixed points on a graph, broadcasting to each other. Nobody has forever tagged perfection, because we are each others' karma.

  That this is technological, that it is not instinctive to all, seems suboptimal.
